{"id":"00375","root":"uni00375_1","name":{"ja":"トラジロー","en":"Torajiro"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"トラジロー","en":"Torajiro"},"aliases":["Trajiro"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-09-16","limited":true,"characterId":231,"profile":{"ja":"虎の獣人。ギャング“獣王会”のリーダー、ワーウルフこと灰狼一郎太の妹分ワータイガーの人間化した姿。自在に獣人形態に変身することができ、獣人化すれば驚異のパワーと俊敏性、鋼鉄も引き裂く鋭い爪と牙、かすり傷ならすぐに癒えてしまうほどの再生能力を有する。さらに、強烈な咆哮で人間の生物としての本能に訴えかけて肉体と精神を束縛し、動きを止めることもできる。その咆哮の威力は、耐性のない人間ならその場で失神してしまうこともあるほど。近頃兄貴分のワーウルフが誰とも知らないタコ女にうつつを抜かしているので少しイライラしている。","en":"Torajiro is a tiger-type beastman and the human-form of the \"Tiger\" member of the gang \"Beast King Society,\" serving under her older brother-figure Hairo Ichirota, known as \"Wolf.\" She can freely shift into her beastman form, gaining astonishing power and speed, razor-sharp claws and fangs that can tear steel, and a regenerative ability that heals minor wounds instantly. Additionally, her thunderous roar can appeal to a human's primal instincts, binding body and mind to halt movement; the roar is so potent that a human without resistance may faint on the spot. Lately she's been irritated because her brother-figure Wolf has become infatuated with a mysterious octopus-woman unknown to anyone."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"梅木ちはる","forms":[{"id":"uni00375_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1042,2084],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[143,286],"def":[116,232],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","760001"],"evolve":[["evo00001",5],["evo00002",15],["evo00003",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00375_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1584,3168],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[221,442],"def":[167,334],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","760001","760002"],"evolve":[["evo00002",10],["evo00003",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00375_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2126,4245],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[